2. Re-captured **7 demo screenshots** on the deployed v0.7.0 app (banner reads `v0.7.0` in every one):
   - `03-ontology-generate-pdf-selected.png` (Documents tab with PFAS PDF auto-selected — 1 / 1 selected)
